statement='For any Boolean private core h(q,u) with equal child means beta0=beta1=beta, any independent Boolean mask s of mean sigma, and F=1 on fresh gate x0 and h*s on x1, supply normalized finite-cost complete child references Q0,Q1 and the SAME mask reference Qs. The incoming core reference is fixed as the actual queried-frequency conditional lift of average Qb, assigning queried frequency absent on zero true rows. Put Dc=average KL(Pb||Qb)-KL(Ph||Qh), ab=Qb(empty), a=average ab, t=Qs(empty), m=sigma^2, p=m*beta^2, E=beta^2*log2(a/sqrt(a0*a1)) with E=0 when beta=0, and J=log2(1+t*a)-average log2(1+t*ab). Then 0<=E<=Dc, J>=0, and the SAME physical-label activation references have exact CE_parent-average CE_child=Delta H_h/2+Lambda with Lambda=-(Dc-m*E+(1+p)*J)/2<=0. Thus any already certified core query Delta H_h<=K*d transfers at the same K to this activation query, whose influence is d/2, with all supplied terminal costs retained. Finite consistent mean-preserving stopping histories telescope; arbitrary unequal-mean histories and inexpensive core reference supply remain open.'
