lesson='''\n## Stage17: equal means, not necessarily balance (2026-10-22/account03)\nFor arbitrary Boolean mask s and core h(q,u), equal ACTUAL child means beta imply the empty unqueried Fourier row has q absent. With incoming actual-conditional mixture lift and absent convention on zero rows, Qh(empty)=a=(Q0(empty)+Q1(empty))/2. Let Dc be the core physical-label KL refund, E=beta^2 log2(a/sqrt(a0*a1)), J=log2(1+t a)-avg log2(1+t ab), t=Qs(empty), m=(E s)^2, p=m beta^2. Exactly Lambda=-(Dc-mE+(1+p)J)/2<=0, because E is one nonnegative row summand of Dc and J>=0. This removes balanced-child hypothesis while keeping equal means, arbitrary supplied complete refs and any independent Boolean mask. It gives Delta CE_F<=Delta H_core/2 and conditional same-K query transfer at actual influence d/2; no extra bank is spent, all terminal bills stay. Finite consistently referenced mean-preserving stopping histories telescope, but cannot in general reveal biased cores completely.\nOpposite tiny means do not satisfy this hypothesis: explicit A020 k3 ghost guard has positive Lambda despite support-aware assignment. Unequal-mean contrast and its profile curvature must be paid from one unused old bank; smallness of means/disagreement alone does not suffice. Partial independent HOLDS of A019-PRIVATE-QUERY-ZERO-ROW-TRANSFER@1 only for exact insertion and balanced absent-row repair; no new acceptance of separate sharp profile/all-k no-go clauses.97432 exact assertions on4104 main+144 boundary cases, plus positive guard. Pilot324/7475 passed; full87.769s exceeded frozen60s estimate (recorded). Lean sign-algebra source uncompiled because memok exit1. No formal or independent acceptance claimed.\n'''
